e umi to v4\r\n2. use umi locale instead of lingui\r\n3. use zustand instead of dva\r\n4. add @ant-design/x to run gpt dialog, for production you may need [@ant-design/x-markdown](https://x.ant.design/x-markdowns/introduce-cn)\r\n5. remove axios to keep it simple\r\n6. remove echart and highcharts, since it's easy to import with ai\r\n7. add page sys/menu back so it's easy to modify layout's menu\r\n\r\nJust keep it simple with limited dependencies.\r\nHave fun😊","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}